<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106597" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλακτέω</span>
			, used only by Poets and only in pres. and
				impf., <i>bark, bay,</i> of dogs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες οὐχ ὑλάουσιν, ἀλλὰ
					περισσαίνουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων . . ἄνδρ᾽ ἀγνοιήσασ᾽ ὑλάει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσπέσιον ὑλάοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.70
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες οὐχ ὑλάοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.162
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. of a
			man, <i>howl,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἣ μάτην ὑλῶ</span> (so <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλακτῶ</span>); <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				61
			</span></i> (lyr., dub.); of Cassandra, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτην ὑλάουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					421
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>bark</i> or <i>bay at,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.5
			</span></i> (so perh.<i><span class="en">
				20.15
			</span></i>, v. supr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
